/* MP Loc Temple More — 神殿杂役廊增量内容（18 页）
   More Hub + 3 个二级入口（杂役廊 / 库房与账 / 旧档与节令）+ Event 7-12 与 Season Extra 的「接近 → 结果」两页结构。
   含完成旗标 $mpDone_Temple_7 .. $mpDone_Temple_12，失败 0 钱 0 线索，不打印计数面板。 */

:: MP Loc Temple More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
北耳堂背后有条窄过道，尽头小屋门上钉着褪色木牌，写着「杂役廊」。炭盆里埋着半熄的木炭，铁壶嘴嘶嘶吐着白气。墙上的石板钉着铜钩，将殿内的差事按去向分成三路：前头杂役廊管晨祷执灯与告解代听，侧翼库房管香灰与旧谱，北廊尽头则管圣骨廊守夜、净火池与四季节令。管杂役的老修士把新削的炭条搁在石槽里：「祭坛记的是神殿脸面，这面石板记的是神殿骨头，挑一处去办吧。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[去杂役廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[查库房与账 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Store]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[翻看旧档与节令 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Archive]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple More Corridor [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
杂役廊内侧的长凳抵着石墙，墙角挂着牛角行灯与告解室的备用黑布帘，后墙那扇包铁皮的小门通往更窄的补记房。<<if $mpDone_Temple_7>>祭坛侧阶的牛角行灯已准时送达，第一声晨钟落得很稳。<<else>>天亮前需要有人提着牛角行灯绕过北廊，赶在第一声晨钟前送到祭坛侧阶。<</if>><<if $mpDone_Temple_8>>告解室松动的木栅已经钉牢，黑布帘后恢复了安静。<<else>>告解室的常任神父发了热，修女正找人去隔栅后头替一个时辰。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回水牌 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpDone_Temple_7>><<mplampicon>><<link [[去晨祷执灯 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Event 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if !$mpDone_Temple_8>><<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[替告解室代听 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Event 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[推开后墙铁皮门 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple More Store [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
偏殿侧面的库房与谱案挨在一起，铜筛、蓝釉罐和待补的旧谱并排摆在木架上，空气里混着香灰与米浆的气味。<<if $mpDone_Temple_9>>祭坛下的香灰已按粗细筛进蓝釉罐，偏殿墙缝也抹平了。<<else>>管祭器的修女摆开三只铜筛，等着人把祭坛香灰按粗细筛分入罐。<</if>><<if $mpDone_Temple_10>>泡水的对经谱已经用米浆补好压平，唱诗班补上了缺掉的那一拍。<<else>>桌上摊着一本被水泡开的旧对经谱，管谱的老修士正愁没人揭页补边。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回水牌 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpDone_Temple_9>><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[筛分祭坛香灰 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Event 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if !$mpDone_Temple_10>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[去补缀旧谱残页 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Event 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple More Archive [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
北廊尽头连着圣骨廊的暗阶与后院净火池，门边第七枚铜钩上挂着随四季更替的节令木牌。<<if $mpDone_Temple_11>>圣骨廊的守夜灯已经添满油，整点的钟绳也重新归位。<<else>>圣骨廊入夜后阴冷幽暗，老修女正找人去廊口矮凳守上半夜。<</if>><<if $mpDone_Temple_12>>后院净火池的炭床已经耙平，朝圣者平安走过了石槽。<<else>>后院净火池的炭床被风吹塌了一角，管火修女等着人去铺炭试步。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回水牌 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpDone_Temple_11>><<mpbellicon>><<link [[去圣骨廊守夜 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Event 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if !$mpDone_Temple_12>><<mplampicon>><<link [[去净火池铺炭试步 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Event 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<mpspringicon>><<link [[应节令杂役 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple Season Extra]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
晨祷在钟响之前就开始了。天还黑着，北廊的窗缝贴地扫来冷风，管灯老修士把一盏牛角罩行灯塞进你手里，火苗在罩内轻轻发抖。祭坛前传来<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>约旦<<else>>值晨修士<</if>>低沉的叮嘱：「灯别灭，钟楼上的执事看见灯到侧阶才敲第一声。」行灯的油只够烧一刻钟，你要么护着灯罩稳步绕廊，要么先在门房添油换芯再走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回杂役廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[护住行灯绕廊 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 7 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpTempleEv7 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_7 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv7 to "fail">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 160>><<link [[添满灯油再送灯 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Event 7 After]]>><<pass 8>><<money -160>><<set $mpTempleEv7 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_7 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添满灯油再送灯 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 7 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpTempleEv7 is "fail">>穿堂冷风从菜园小门猛地灌进来，牛角灯罩里的火苗噗地熄灭。你摸黑折回廊下重新点火，脚踝在湿石阶上磕得生疼，等赶到侧阶时第一声晨钟已经迟了半拍。<<else>>你用身体挡住菜园篱笆掠来的斜风，将温黄的行灯稳稳送到祭坛侧阶。钟楼上随即落下清越的第一声晨钟，祭坛前的烛火一盏接一盏亮起，掌心的微汗也渐渐散去。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回杂役廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回杂役总水牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
告解室的常任神父发了热，修女把黑布帘挂好，让你在木栅后坐一个时辰。狭小的隔间里只有一只半冷的脚炉，木栅横档的铁钉松了半截。隔栅另一头传来压低的嗓音：「我把回廊尽头那扇门的钥匙还错了钩子，现在挂的是灯绳。」帘外换班铃声轻响，你可以静心听完细节，或趁空当把松动的木栅钉牢。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回杂役廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[隔着木栅静听 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple Event 8 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 380 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpTempleEv8 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_8 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv8 to "fail">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link [[换钉修栅 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 8 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<money -200>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv8 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_8 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">换钉修栅 (0:10)（钱和手艺都不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 8 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpTempleEv8 is "fail">>窄凳在石地上刮出一声脆响，隔栅后的人立刻屏住呼吸，匆匆掀帘离去。你在昏暗里摸索着收拾残局，指尖被木刺与旧钉扎得生疼，只落得满屋冷风。<<else>>你屏息料理好隔间里的活计，离帘时又把松动的木栅横档重新扶正。修女回来收拾水罐时朝你微微颔首，窗外吹进的冷风总算不再震得木格乱晃。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回杂役廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回杂役总水牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
晨祷散场后，祭坛四周积着厚厚一层香灰与烛泪，管祭器的修女把三只铜筛并排摆开。后门外有个玻璃作坊的学徒背着碎玻璃袋探头低语：「最细的那层银白灰能擦亮模具，我拿铜子跟你们换。」偏殿墙根的细缝还在渗水，你要么稳住手腕筛出细灰，要么调好灰浆把渗水的墙缝抹平。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回库房区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Store]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[稳住手腕筛灰 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 9 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpTempleEv9 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_9 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("temple_more_ev9_ash")>><<money 60>><</if>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv9 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 140 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<link [[调好灰浆抹墙缝 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 9 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 140>><<money -140>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv9 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_9 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">调好灰浆抹墙缝 (0:10)（钱和手艺都不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 9 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpTempleEv9 is "fail">>穿堂风猛地灌进后门，手边的灰料被吹得四散，呛得你连连咳嗽。受潮的灰粉结成了硬块，活儿做到一半便再也接不下去，偏殿墙角的水痕还在一道道往下淌。<<else>>你把香灰按粗细分装妥当，又调好灰浆抹平了偏殿墙根的渗水细缝。管祭器的修女把麻袋扎紧收好，玻璃作坊的学徒也满意地背起沉甸甸的模具袋离去。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回库房区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Store]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回杂役总水牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
一本泡过水的对经谱摊在木案上，下半截纸页粘成一团，旁边研着稀米浆。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>管谱的见习生<</if>>摘下眼镜擦了擦，压低声音说：「缺的是午钟前那段应答，唱诗班唱到那里总会少一口气。」旧谱匣的边角已被虫蛀空，你要么借炭盆温气揭页补缀，要么添置一只防潮新谱匣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回库房区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Store]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[研浆补缀残页 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple Event 10 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpTempleEv10 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_10 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv10 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 220>><<link [[添钱换防潮谱匣 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Event 10 After]]>><<pass 8>><<money -220>><<set $mpTempleEv10 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_10 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添钱换防潮谱匣 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 10 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpTempleEv10 is "fail">>炭盆离得太近，受潮的纸页边缘忽然卷曲发脆，一碰便裂开一道细口。窗外练唱的木尺声再次错了一拍，你只能先把半干的谱本合上，免得字迹彻底损毁。<<else>>你借着炭盆的温气把受潮的谱页一张张理开，缺字处补齐，松散的页角也重新压平，最后稳稳收进干爽的谱匣。窗外唱诗班的歌声重新合在一处，午钟前的应答终于不再少那一拍。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回库房区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Store]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回杂役总水牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
圣骨廊夹在回廊与地窖之间，石壁上的两盏油灯只够烧到半夜，地窖深处不时传来暗水拍岸的轻响。老修女把一段新灯芯交给你，低声叮嘱：「若灯焰发甜，别闻，那是油里混了东西；整点钟不响就去拉钟绳。」廊顶传来极轻的脚步声，你可以持灯守在廊口，或先把守夜灯续满净油。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回旧档区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Archive]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[持灯守住廊口 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple Event 11 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpTempleEv11 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_11 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv11 to "fail">><<stress 6>><<tiredness 4>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplampicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 180 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link [[换净油续满壁灯 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Event 11 After]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($money or 0) gte 180>><<money -180>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv11 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_11 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">换净油续满壁灯 (0:08)（钱和手艺都不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 11 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpTempleEv11 is "fail">>半夜里守夜灯忽然黯淡下去，你被呛人的油烟熏得头脑发沉，起身去料理时又一脚踩空了半级窄梯。廊顶的脚步声在黑暗里远去，你揉着发酸的脚踝熬到了换班。<<else>>你及时拨正灯芯、续上净油，又在整点时稳稳拉响了窄梯尽头的钟绳。廊顶窥探的动静被钟声惊退，圣骨廊整夜安稳无事，直到晨光透进高窗，你才轻轻松了口气。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧档区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Archive]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回杂役总水牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
后院的净火池是一口浅底石槽，炭床烧得发白，靠里的炭堆却被夜风吹塌了一角。一名年轻朝圣者攥着石片站在池边犹豫，铁栅旁的<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>约旦<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>轻声提醒：「想清楚再走，半途回头比不走更伤。」管火修女把长柄铁耙递给你，你可以亲自赤足试步，或先替池子把炭床铺平。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回旧档区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Archive]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[赤足踏过炭床 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple Event 12 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<set $mpTempleEv12 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_12 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<pain 1>><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv12 to "fail">><<stress 7>><<pain 4>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[持铁耙铺平炭床 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 12 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpTempleEv12 to "ok">><<set $mpDone_Temple_12 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv12 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 12 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpTempleEv12 is "fail">>迎风一侧的炭床没有压实，火舌猛地从缝隙里窜起，滚烫的火星灼得你手背与脚背生疼。管火修女连忙递来湿布让你退到池边冷敷，朝圣者见状也暂时收起了石片。<<else>>你顺着风向把炭床理得均匀扎实，迎风的缺口也重新堵好。朝圣者踩着平顺的炭面稳步走过石槽，廊下执事在名册上记下一笔，朝你投来赞许的目光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧档区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Archive]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回杂役总水牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Season Extra [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
杂役廊的第七枚铜钩挂着随四季更替的节令木牌。<<if Time.season is "spring">>开春后园化冻，修女正挑拣留种的麦粒，葡萄架下的麻绳也待重捆。<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>入夏前殿闷热，彩窗晒得发白，井台边急需汲水兑薄荷镇暑。<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>秋风卷落叶入阶，祭坛换上了深色帷布，供桌正等着头捆新谷。<<else>>入冬石阶覆满薄冰，殿内烧起炭盆，铅条窗缝急待糊纸挡风。<</if>>管事的老修士敲了敲木牌：「节令活计看天行事，挑一件做妥当便算数。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回旧档区 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More Archive]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpspringicon>><<link [[顺应时令护殿 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Season Extra After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpTempleSeasonOk to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpTempleSeasonOk to 0>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<link [[出钱添置节令物 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Season Extra After]]>><<pass 8>><<money -150>><<set $mpTempleSeasonOk to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱添置节令物 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Season Extra After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpTempleSeasonOk is 1>>你按着当季的规矩把后园与前殿的节令活计一一料理妥当，老修士在节令牌背面添上一道浅痕。殿内外的器物各归其位，连穿堂风吹过廊柱的声音都显得格外安宁。<<else>>天色突生变化，手头的节令杂活做到一半便被风雨打乱了章法。你忙活了半晌也没能把差事收尾，只能拍掉袖口沾上的灰土，将疲累留在自己身上。<</if>>
<br><br>
